ial cross section for a different process (W+c), not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:hh_incl_signal_strength", "why": "This is a signal strength, which is a ratio of cross sections, not the total cross section itself."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "why": "This is a differential fiducial cross section, which is more specific and not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_z", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (Z) and includes branching fractions, making it more specific than the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_wplus", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (W+) and includes branching fractions, making it more specific than the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-inclusive-xsec", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (t-tbar-W), not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "why": "This is a differential cross section, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_wminus", "why": "This is a product of the total cross section and a branching fraction, which is not the total cross section itself."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "why": "This is about effective couplings and total width, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_w", "why": "This is a product of the total cross section and a branching fraction, which is not the total cross section itself."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_inel", "why": "This is the total inelastic cross section, not the total Higgs boson production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-minus-xsec", "why": "This is the cross section for a different process (t-tbar-W-), not the total Higgs boson production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-plus-xsec", "why": "This is the cross section for a different process (t-tbar-W+), not the total Higgs boson production cross se